00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:22.699
But, you know, none of these countries are
350 million people, but the entire European

00:11:22.699 --> 00:11:26.600
Union is eight hundred and fifty million people.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:32.470
And to the best of my knowledge, every country
